{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-008",
    "title": "封山钟响"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_041",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“留在玄霄宗，把昨夜的东西交给我。我可以让你继续修炼，也可以替你查阅外门旧档。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "戒律堂的火把在山道上亮了一夜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1011,
          "end": 1011
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临和顾长离没有回听雨院，而是躲进外门旧库房。库房堆着废弃的灯油桶和断裂的木架，尘土里混着一种发苦的药味。两人隔着一扇缺页的木门，听见搜山弟子从屋外经过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1013,
          "end": 1013
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“西坡没有人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1015,
          "end": 1015
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封条动过，井口也没有痕迹。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1017,
          "end": 1017
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把杂木林再搜一遍。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1019,
          "end": 1019
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "脚步声渐渐远去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1021,
          "end": 1021
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离这才松开手里的铜针：“把残印给我看。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1023,
          "end": 1023
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临摊开手掌。淡青色纹路在皮肤下缓慢游动，像一条被困住的细蛇。它没有带来灵力，反而让他的手臂发冷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1025,
          "end": 1025
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你忘了什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1027,
          "end": 1027
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“北河城一棵树。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1029,
          "end": 1029
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1031,
          "end": 1031
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“暂时没有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1033,
          "end": 1033
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有安慰他，只从腰间取出一截黑线，绕在他腕上。黑线碰到残印时立刻绷紧，像在测量什么。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1035,
          "end": 1035
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这能遮住它？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1037,
          "end": 1037
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只能让别人暂时看不清。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1039,
          "end": 1039
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括沈砚秋？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1041,
          "end": 1041
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她若亲自查，不包括。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1043,
          "end": 1043
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天将亮时，搜山的火把终于熄灭。陆照临和顾长离从旧库房出来，沿雨廊返回登记堂。昨夜的雨又落下来，细密的水线把廊外的山景剪成一格一格。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1045,
          "end": 1045
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋已经在那里等着。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1047,
          "end": 1047
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她面前摆着三件物品：一截断灯芯、一枚半环铜片，还有一只黑漆木盒。断灯芯和陆照临藏起来的那截一模一样，铜片却比他们找到的更完整。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1049,
          "end": 1049
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“戒律堂在西坡捡到的。”沈砚秋说，“你们昨夜去了哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1051,
          "end": 1051
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离先开口：“听雨院。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1053,
          "end": 1053
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋看她：“你袖中的账单，什么时候交出来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1055,
          "end": 1055
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的手指微微一紧。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1057,
          "end": 1057
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有说话。沈砚秋的目光从两人脸上掠过，最后落在陆照临被黑线缠住的手腕。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1059,
          "end": 1059
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你受伤了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1061,
          "end": 1061
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“旧伤。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1063,
          "end": 1063
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们都喜欢说旧伤。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1065,
          "end": 1065
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她打开黑漆木盒。盒中没有法器，只有一张被水浸过的薄纸。纸上画着一条山路，尽头标着一个模糊的驿站名。陆照临一眼认出，那正是第三章烧焦账单上“送入西坡旧井”之后被撕掉的部分。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1067,
          "end": 1067
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青衫人笑了笑：“沈执事还记得我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1093,
          "end": 1093
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟的人不能进玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1095,
          "end": 1095
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已经进来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1097,
          "end": 1097
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜说话时，目光越过沈砚秋，落到陆照临身上。他没有问陆照临看见了什么，只问：“你愿不愿意承认自己看见过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1099,
          "end": 1099
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1101,
          "end": 1101
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“承认什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1103,
          "end": 1103
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一盏没有被点燃，却一直在带路的灯。”叶观澜把小灯放在廊柱边，“陆沉舟曾替归墟盟送过一次信。最后一次有人看见他，是在玄霄宗西坡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1105,
          "end": 1105
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“什么时候？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1107,
          "end": 1107
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前，冬至前七日。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1109,
          "end": 1109
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“值房名册写的是三年前春末。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1111,
          "end": 1111
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜的笑意淡了：“那就是第一个矛盾。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1113,
          "end": 1113
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你记错了。”沈砚秋说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1115,
          "end": 1115
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记错，还是名册被改过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1117,
          "end": 1117
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "廊中长明灯同时晃动。最左边那盏灯的火焰向下压了一寸，灯油却没有减少。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1119,
          "end": 1119
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜从腰间解下铜环，放在廊柱上：“等你找到第二个矛盾，再决定要不要相信我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1121,
          "end": 1121
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋朝戒律堂方向抬手。两名弟子立刻从转角出现。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1123,
          "end": 1123
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“拿下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1125,
          "end": 1125
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜没有反抗。他任由弟子抓住手臂，目光仍停在陆照临身上：“旧驿道的第一座驿站，不点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1127,
          "end": 1127
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你想让他去？”沈砚秋问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1129,
          "end": 1129
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只是告诉他一个地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1131,
          "end": 1131
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别听他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1141,
          "end": 1141
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这句话落下时，第七声钟响了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1252,
          "end": 1252
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "山门方向的铁闸微微震动，远处最左边的长明灯忽然亮起。火焰高得反常，像有人在灯芯里吹了一口气。下一刻，演武坪的地面传来细微的颤抖。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1254,
          "end": 1254
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有人都听见了地底的回响。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1256,
          "end": 1256
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "咚。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1258,
          "end": 1258
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "咚。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1260,
          "end": 1260
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两声之后，钟声继续响起，仿佛什么也没有发生。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1262,
          "end": 1262
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋闭了闭眼，重新拿起公告：“散会。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1264,
          "end": 1264
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "弟子们被执事驱散。陆照临没有动，顾长离也留在原地。高台上的黑色木屏裂开一道细缝，细缝里渗出灰白色粉末，与废井石屑一模一样。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1266,
          "end": 1266
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋走下高台，停在陆照临面前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1268,
          "end": 1268
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你有两个选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1270,
          "end": 1270
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1272,
          "end": 1272
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留在玄霄宗，把昨夜的东西交给我。我可以让你继续修炼，也可以替你查阅外门旧档。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1274,
          "end": 1274
        }
      }
    ],
